  "notes": "{粘|ねば}る has both abstract (persistence) and physical (stickiness) meanings.\n\nSENSE 1 - PERSISTENCE:\n- {粘|ねば}り{強|づよ}い: tenacious, persistent\n- {粘|ねば}り{勝|が}ち: winning through persistence\n- {粘|ねば}りに{粘|ねば}る: to persist stubbornly\n\nSENSE 2 - STICKINESS:\n- {粘|ねば}り{気|け}: stickiness, viscosity\n- {粘|ねば}{粘|ねば}する: to be slimy/sticky (onomatopoeia)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {粘着|ねんちゃく}: adhesion\n- {粘液|ねんえき}: mucus, slime",
